<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Final Rest</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 70), Paladin (guild level 80)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast final rest &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast final rest</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A holy prayer, made with a touch, to grant the undead their final rest and 
destroy them. The better your divine power and sphere, the harder it strikes. 
Only the undead are touched by it: cast on the living, nothing happens. 
It does the same against any armour, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. You must be standing. It is also 
found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Turn Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>